<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Memento"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="TV动画《Re:从零开始的异世界生活 第二季》ED1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="OVA《Re:从零开始的异世界生活 冰结之绊》主题曲"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="纪念品"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="nonoc"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活」2nd seasonエンディングテーマ「Memento」 - EP"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活」第2期エンディングテーマ「Memento」 歌：nonoc"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Memento"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1475841362"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001Slaf71E8pr9"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="276341189"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5OJ0kXGbl2ZMmjbVZVhmrI"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1523975120"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPD732000061"/><amll:meta key="作曲" value="Tom-H@ck"/><amll:meta key="作詞" value="hotaru"/><amll:meta key="編曲" value="Tom-H@ck"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="68000793"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ranhengzhang"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en"><text for="L1">The turning time, the tragedy etched deep</text><text for="L2">Embrace them all and let us begin again</text><text for="L3">My trembling heart foresees the coming sorrow</text><text for="L4">My fragile self has nowhere left to flee</text><text for="L5">If someday even this snow will cease to fall…</text><text for="L6">I grip the will to be wounded and the words you left behind</text><text for="L7">Knocking again and again on the bolted door of sealed memories</text><text for="L8">If anything could thaw these frozen tears, it is that tenderness</text><text for="L9">No matter how many times, never cast away the dream of tomorrow</text><text for="L10">May the obstructed road, the traces of life, stretch ever onward</text><text for="L11">Kindling a faint and fragile hope</text><text for="L12">Sinking deep into the silent abyss</text><text for="L13">Gazing at that beloved smile drifting in the distance</text><text for="L14">My chest wrenches in agony, as if screaming out</text><text for="L15">Even now I keep the unhealing sin hidden far away</text><text for="L16">So deeply cherished — then why? The more precious, the more I long to forget</text><text for="L17">That innocent, unchanging heart of a child</text><text for="L18">Still frozen since that powerless day, waiting all this time</text><text for="L19">The past, the present, the future</text><text for="L20">Surely all of them will converge</text><text for="L21">The scattered fragments of myself, here as well</text><text for="L22">Again and again, that door, those sealed memories…</text><text for="L23">Again and again, the dream of tomorrow…</text><text for="L24">Knocking again and again on the bolted door of sealed memories</text><text for="L25">If anything could thaw these frozen tears, it is that tenderness</text><text for="L26">No matter how many times, never cast away the dream of tomorrow</text><text for="L27">May the obstructed road, the traces of life, stretch ever onward</text><text for="L28">Over and over, no matter how many tragedies we overcome</text><text for="L29">Returning once more to my ever-weak self</text><text for="L30">Ever searching for true hope alone</text><text for="L31">Shattered to pieces until all returns to nothing</text><text for="L32">Over and over, no matter how many tragedies we overcome</text><text for="L33">Ever searching for true hope alone</text><text for="L34">Over and over, no matter how many tragedies we overcome</text><text for="L35">Ever searching for true hope alone</text></translation><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">轮回流转的时光 铭心刻骨的悲剧</text><text for="L2">拥入怀中 再度启程</text><text for="L3">颤抖的心 预感悲伤将至</text><text for="L4">依旧脆弱的自己 已无路可逃</text><text for="L5">若有一天 这场雪也会停歇……</text><text for="L6">将受伤的觉悟 与你留下的话 紧握手中</text><text for="L7">一次次叩响 那紧锁的门扉 那封存的记忆</text><text for="L8">若有什么能消融冰封之泪 便是那份温柔</text><text for="L9">无论多少次 都不要舍弃 对明日的憧憬</text><text for="L10">愿那被阻断的路 那生命的痕迹 能延续至远方</text><text for="L11">点亮一缕微弱希望</text><text for="L12">沉沉坠入静寂的深渊</text><text for="L13">望着远方浮现的 那令人怀念的笑颜</text><text for="L14">胸口阵阵绞痛 仿佛正哭喊着</text><text for="L15">时至今日 仍将那未愈之罪 远远藏匿</text><text for="L16">如此深爱 却为何 越是珍贵 越想忘却</text><text for="L17">那颗永不改变 纯真如初的 幼小心灵</text><text for="L18">在无力回天的那一日 冰封至今 始终等待</text><text for="L19">过去 现在 与未来</text><text for="L20">一切终将交汇</text><text for="L21">支离破碎的自我 也在此处</text><text for="L22">一次次 那扇门 那封存的记忆……</text><text for="L23">一次次 对明日的憧憬……</text><text for="L24">一次次叩响 那紧锁的门扉 那封存的记忆</text><text for="L25">若有什么能消融冰封之泪 便是那份温柔</text><text for="L26">无论多少次 都不要舍弃 对明日的憧憬</text><text for="L27">愿那被阻断的路 那生命的痕迹 能延续至远方</text><text for="L28">反反复复 纵使跨越重重悲剧</text><text for="L29">辗转重返 依旧脆弱的自己</text><text for="L30">苦苦追寻 只为真正的希望</text><text for="L31">支离破碎 直至一切归于虚无</text><text for="L32">反反复复 纵使跨越重重悲剧</text><text for="L33">苦苦追寻 只为真正的希望</text><text for="L34">反反复复 纵使跨越重重悲剧</text><text for="L35">苦苦追寻 只为真正的希望</text></translation></translations><songwriters/><transliterations><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn"><text for="L1"><span begin="0.760" end="1.020" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ku</span> <span begin="1.020" end="1.230" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ri</span> <span begin="1.230" end="1.660" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ka e</span> <span begin="1.660" end="2.130" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">su</span> <span begin="2.230" end="2.700" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">to ki</span> <span begin="2.700" end="2.980" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">o</span> <span begin="3.170" end="3.650" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ki za</span> <span begin="3.650" end="3.880" xml